n class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">kg</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第三步（求和）</strong>：草最少同化量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=10+15=25\\,\\mathrm{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">kg</span></span></span></span></span>。选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>四步模板</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>①找最高营养级&quot;重量&quot;</strong>（题给的 kg/J）；\n<strong>②按食物来源比例切分</strong>；\n<strong>③每支链数传递环节</strong>：生产者→…→该营养级有几条箭头，每一条除以一次效率（最少÷20%，最多÷10%）；\n<strong>④所有支链求和</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：能量沿每一条食物链独立传递（两条链并联，不共用能量），所以&quot;先分配、后逐级除&quot;；&quot;至少&quot;取 20%（传递效率越高，用掉的能量越少→需要生产者越少）。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"某生态系统的食物网为：草→兔→鹰、草→鼠→鹰。鹰每增加 1 k g 1\\,\\mathrm{kg} 1 kg 同化量，其食物中 2 5 \\dfrac25 5 2 ​ 来自兔、 3 5 \\dfrac35 5 3 ​ 来自鼠。相邻营养级间的能量传","source":"自编（经典考法：多条食物链加权计算为新高考解答题高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"解答题","risk":"最少/至少用 20%（效率最大=损失最少），最多/最大用 10%；先按比例分配最高营养级的食物来源，再逐营养级除以传递效率；跨营养级数数：生产者→初级→次级…鹰吃兔吃草：2 个传递环节（每环节除一次 20%）。","fit":["多食物链能量流向","至少/最多取 10%~20%","由高营养级反推生产者","解答题模板步骤"],"updated":"Wed Mar 05 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"ecology","title":"生物与环境"},{"slug":"ecosystem","title":"群落与生态系统"},{"slug":"energy-flow-network","title":"能量流动多链计算·先分配再除以效率（模板）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"ecosystem","title":"群落与生态系统","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"energy-flow-max","title":"能量流动变式·最多需要生产者（10% 取法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"energy-flow","title":"能量流动计算（10%/20% 传送带）","type":"example"},{"slug":"matter-energy-cycle","title":"物质循环与能量流动·特点辨析","type":"example"},{"slug":"niche-succession","title":"群落演替类型判断（弃耕农田）","type":"example"}]}